.TH QODE 1 "" "qode" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qode \- native Qt code editor with integrated terminal and language server client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qode
[\fB\-\-new\-window\fR] [\fIproject\-folder\fR | \fIfile\fR ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
QODE is a code editor with a project explorer, tabbed syntax-highlighted editor, split views,
Git integration, project search and an integrated terminal (Ctrl+J). It talks to language servers
(clangd for C/C++, kotlin-lsp for Kotlin) found on PATH; servers are never bundled.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-new\-window
Do not restore the previous session.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/QODE/
Settings (QODE.conf) and per-project data (projects/*.json).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/QODE/
Language servers downloaded by QODE.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/QODE/
Language server caches and unpacked library sources.
.PP
All of these are deleted when the package is removed, unless QODE_KEEP_USER_DATA=1 is set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qode\-remove\-lsp (1)
